B.avn=new A.c4("You have the rights to know, access, correct and delete personal information, to opt out of its sale or sharing (we do neither), to limit the use of sensitive information, and not to be discriminated against for using these rights. We answer within 45 days (extendable by 45 days, with notice).")
B.avr=new A.c4("Ch\xednh s\xe1ch kh\xf4ng \xe1p d\u1ee5ng cho d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a b\xean th\u1ee9 ba m\xe0 b\u1ea1n d\xf9ng c\xf9ng Pandlish (v\xed d\u1ee5 Apple, Google, Facebook); c\xe1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\xf3 c\xf3 ch\xednh s\xe1ch b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt ri\xeang.")
