B.a8Y=s(["Ch\xfang m\xecnh kh\xf4ng b\xe1n, cho thu\xea, trao \u0111\u1ed5i hay mua b\xe1n d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 h\xecnh th\u1ee9c n\xe0o \u2014 h\xe0nh vi mua b\xe1n d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n b\u1ecb nghi\xeam c\u1ea5m theo Lu\u1eadt 91/2025/QH15.","Pandlish kh\xf4ng t\xedch h\u1ee3p SDK qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o, m\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o, c\xf4ng c\u1ee5 ph\xe2n t\xedch hay c\xf4ng c\u1ee5 theo d\xf5i c\u1ee7a b\xean th\u1ee9 ba.","Theo \u0111\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a CCPA / CPRA, ch\xfang m\xecnh kh\xf4ng \u201cb\xe1n\u201d (sell) v\xe0 kh\xf4ng \u201cchia s\u1ebb\u201d (share) th\xf4ng tin c\xe1 nh\xe2n cho qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o h\xe0nh vi, k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 th\xf4ng tin c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u01b0\u1edbi 16 tu\u1ed5i.","Ch\xfang m\xecnh kh\xf4ng d\xf9ng d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh ho\xe0n to\xe0n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng g\xe2y \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng ph\xe1p l\xfd ho\u1eb7c \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\xe1ng k\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ea1n."],t.s)
