B.ahZ=s(["Encryption in transit with HTTPS / TLS.","Passwords hashed with bcrypt; short-lived sign-in tokens kept in the operating system's secure storage.","Refresh tokens are replaced on every use; if an old one is used again, every related session is revoked at once to stop session theft.","The database and cache are reachable only from the application server; admin access is limited to people who need it.","Rate limits on sign-in and messages against password guessing and spam."],t.s)
