B.avy=new A.c4("When you write to us through the Contact page we store the topic, the message, your name and e-mail (if you give them), language, platform (web / iOS / Android), the time and \u2014 if you are signed in \u2014 a link to your account. We do not store your IP address with the message.")
B.avK=new A.c4("You must tick the consent box before sending. Messages are used only to reply to you, support you and improve Pandlish, and are deleted automatically after 12 months.")
B.acE=s([B.avy,B.avK],t.L)
