B.aw0=new A.c4("If a personal-data breach occurs we notify the Department of Cybersecurity and High-Tech Crime Prevention (A05) of the Ministry of Public Security within 72 hours of discovering it, as required; notify the competent GDPR supervisory authority where required; and promptly inform affected users with advice on protecting themselves.")
B.aj4=s([B.aw0],t.L)
