B.avp=new A.c4("Data is shared only as far as necessary with:")
B.a5l=s(["Our server and database hosting (cloud) providers \u2014 they process data on our instructions under contracts with data-protection terms.","Apple, Google, Facebook \u2014 when you choose to sign in with them, buy through their stores or use your device's speech services.","Competent authorities \u2014 only when the law requires it, following due legal process."],t.s)
