B.awl=new A.cF("device","D\u1eef li\u1ec7u ch\u1ec9 l\u01b0u tr\xean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n",B.a7U)
B.avX=new A.c4("Pandlish suits learners of many ages, including children. Children can play the whole game without an account, in which case their data stays on the device.")
B.agI=s(["Vietnam: processing the personal data of children (under 16) requires the consent of a parent or guardian, and also the child's own consent from age 7. A child's account must therefore be created or approved by a parent / guardian.","United States (COPPA): we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 without verifiable parental consent.","EU / UK: below the digital age of consent in your country (13\u201316), a parent or guardian must consent.","Parents and guardians can ask to access, correct or delete their child's data and withdraw consent at any time. If we learn we collected a child's data without valid consent, we delete it."],t.s)
