B.av6=new A.fb(B.a7z)
B.avt=new A.c4("On iOS and Android the data lives in a SQLite database in the app's private storage, which other apps cannot read. The Pandlish website is a showcase only and keeps no learning progress: your browser just keeps your language and the SquidType word list (IndexedDB / Origin Private File System). The website uses no advertising or tracking cookies.")
B.avj=new A.Dp("To delete it: uninstall the app or, on the web, clear Pandlish's site data in your browser settings. Device-only data is then gone for good \u2014 we cannot restore it because we never received it.")
